  "body": "## What changed\n\n- New fixture `testdata/models/filleted_block.sc`. It is a 40 x 30 x 20 mm block with a blend face, saved by SolidCraft 0.48.1.\n- New fixture `testdata/models/filleted_block.step`. It is the STEP export of the same design, from SolidCraft 0.48.1.\n- New test `a_release_design_with_fillets_imports_the_body_of_its_step_export` in `crates/kernel/tests/solidcraft_import/release_fixture.rs`. It imports the two files and compares:\n  - the design name (`filleted_block`) and the units (mm);\n  - the face count (8, with one blend face in the `.sc`);\n  - the bounding box (within 1e-3 mm of -20,-15,0 .. 20,15,20);\n  - the volume (within 1e-9 relative, and equal to the modeller's volume);\n  - the machining meshes at 0.005 mm: no open sides, the deviation is not more than the tolerance, the triangle counts are equal, and the volumes agree.\n- The STEP agreement bench (`crates/kernel/tests/step_agreement/rows.rs`) gets a row for `filleted_block.step`: `Truck::NotRecorded`, \"no truck reading; unit agrees\", \"watertight, within tolerance\".\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/2578-sc-blend-fixture.md`.\n\n## Readings\n\n| | `.sc` | `.step` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Faces | 8 (1 blend) | 8 |\n| Volume, mm^3 | 23858.637478691868 | 23858.637478691864 |\n| Mesh triangles at 0.005 mm | 1622 | 1622 |\n| Mesh volume, mm^3 | 23858.16931445716 | 23858.16931445716 |\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `solidcraft_import::release_fixture::a_release_design_with_fillets_imports_the_body_of_its_step_export`\n- `step_agreement::step_filleted_block`, `step_agreement::step_files_agree_or_refuse_by_name`\n\n## Gates\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 29 steps, 1 red step (`step_agreement`: the new STEP file had no row). After the row was added, `step_agreement` passes 33/33. `solidcraft_import` passes 9/9. `step_nesting::every_step_fixture_is_under_the_cap` passes.\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-kernel -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No heavy lane runs: the change adds tests and fixtures only.\n- The fixture is from SolidCraft 0.48.1 only. A later SolidCraft release needs a new fixture of its own.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2578\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
